{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "nav",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Animation｜当前结构与职责\n箭头按调用、继承、持有或数据传递标签阅读。\n原生Slot唯一混合Mesh姿态；CMC唯一执行胶囊XYZ。Animation发布配置并消费语义。\n[[Animation/结构|结构文档]] · [[GGYGO_流程_动画表现.canvas|表现流程]] · [[Animation/动作姿态修正|姿态契约]] · [[GGYGO_流程_动作姿态修正.canvas|姿态子图]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 3580,
      "height": 210,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "source",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## CMC / ASC / Pawn（权威）\nCMC拥有运动段、time/cycle/alpha、请求与胶囊执行。\n公开PublishLocomotionSourceBinding接收原配置；Retire仅撤原producer/代次。\nCapture只读步态/输入/Stop/TurnBack；ASC提供Tag，Pawn提供朝向。\n[[Movement/结构|Movement]] · [[AbilitySystem/结构|GAS]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 280,
      "width": 390,
      "height": 380,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "capture",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## FGGYGOAnimationStateCapture\n`Capture(OutFrame, OutDebug, Pawn)` → 在游戏线程取 CMC/ASC/Pawn 事实，集中处理缺失来源。",
      "x": 500,
      "y": 280,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "frame",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## FGGYGOAnimationStateFrame\n`bHasMoveInput`、`WalkRunBlendAlpha`、`StopMotionType`、步态、转身相位、状态 Tag 等只读语义；不存 ABP 状态名、资产或连线。",
      "x": 1000,
      "y": 280,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 260,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "base",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## UGGYGOAnimInstanceBase\n原Initialize/Update检查Owner与source配置，调用CMC公开sink；配置不变复用binding。\nUninitialize/Owner替换先撤原source代次，再Reset帧/Debug并调用派生Hook。\n持publication handle，不持motion clock或Graph输出。\n语义查询只供ABP读取。",
      "x": 1000,
      "y": 620,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 400,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "abp",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## ABP_Pyrios\n消费StateFrame/兼容字段，选Sequence/BS；Locomotion Player/相位保持。\nFullBody ActionPoseSlot替换旧Slot/ModifyBone；保留原空间转换/Inertialization。\nRequiredPoseCorrectionSlot=FullBody；Bip001/Root与原组件对齐由ABP配置。\n视觉与CMC不承诺同clock。",
      "x": 1000,
      "y": 1060,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 340,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "compat",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## UZZZAnimInstance / Snapshot（兼容）\nResolveLocomotionSourceBinding解析本人AnimSet；检查真实引用/rate/length/BS样本配置。\nStateFrame→旧Snapshot；MapMovementState只复制alpha→GaitBlendY，Stop→StopValue。\nReset清Memory/Snap/Events借用与表现字段，保留AnimSet/Tuning。\n无走跑插值、早停或曲线计时器。",
      "x": 500,
      "y": 750,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 420,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "data",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## FZZZAnimSet / Tuning\n五个single route→既有序列表；walkRun→实际BS，Loop来自BS样本。\n六个SourceKey是明确配置，缺key/asset携Error，不选替代。\n[[GGYGO_结构_动画曲线.canvas|源引用与算法]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1050,
      "width": 390,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "contract",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 配置与表现两种接口\nAnimation→CMC：immutable source binding，仅引用/metadata/身份，无曲线副本。\nCMC/ASC→Capture→ABP：只读语义；Graph速度不反馈CMC。\nMissing/Invalid可接收但不授曲线执行；CMC在必需请求拒绝，Fixed/GA不误报。\nOwner/config退休仅清本人旧代次；强资产引用有界，残留快照不授权后继。\n七旧Locomotion DA已解绑/删除/fresh冷读；历史类/工具仍保留。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1490,
      "width": 1450,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "combo_sources",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 普攻 AnimSequence（已存在）\nNormal_01/02/03 与对应 End：60 fps，共用 Pyrios Skeleton。\n无 Notify，原生 Root Motion=false；含 RootMotion_* 曲线。\n[[Animation/普攻动画实施|资产事实与契约]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1920,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 320,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "combo_montages",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 三份普攻 Montage（初版已保存）\nAM_Pyrios_Attack_Normal_01/02/03。Main → End → 停止，Slot=FullBody。\nMain 全段 + End 前 30/45/90 帧（60 fps）；BlendIn/Out=0.10/0.25 s。\n[[Animation/普攻动画实施|实际帧区间与验证范围]]",
      "x": 520,
      "y": 1920,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 320,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "combo_ga",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## PlayerCombo GA（跨模块）\nComboStep引用Montage；GA管换段/输入与原资源。\nMain调用BeginMontageActionMotion，持精确CMC句柄；Section/失败/结束清本人资源。\n历史OnFailed核原Activation后强制End。\n[[计划_玩家普攻连段|GA与验收]]",
      "x": 1040,
      "y": 2100,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "combo_notify",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## GameplayEventWindow\nHit/Combo独立时间窗口发Begin/End GameplayEvent。\nGA核原播放来源，Combat负责命中去重，伤害走GAS。\n窗口资产配置与完整命中/网络验收分开。\n[[Animation/普攻动画实施|帧区间与边界]]",
      "x": 520,
      "y": 2380,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 320,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "combo_slot_gate",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 已保存的FullBody接线\n状态机→ActionPoseSlot→原LocalToCS→原CSToLocal→原Inertialization→Root。\n旧Slot/ModifyBone已删除，AlwaysUpdateSourcePose=true。\n原对齐Z=50.8019981384，角色必需FullBody；其余24图保持。\n[[Animation/普攻动画实施|实际ABP配置]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 2380,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 350,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "bh3_import",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 2890,
      "width": 600,
      "height": 310,
      "text": "## BH3 Kevin DemonBattle：独立导入\n模型/StandBy已保存与预览；75条可导入动画全部成功，4条源空片段未生成。\n独立Skeleton，保留原始根层级；渲染按槽名接线。\n[[Animation/BH3_Kevin_DemonBattle导入|导入说明与验收]]\n[[GGYGO_流程_BH3_DemonBattle导入.canvas|导入流程子图]]",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "kevin_combat",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 3340,
      "width": 650,
      "height": 310,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "## Kevin战斗动画（资产待生成）\n55独立Montage；Ice01/02候选窗口；Prop1端点与独立ABP。\n已有资产只读核验，缺失才创建；Movement提供InPlace并执行位移。\n完整链接与3项Animation安全自动化通过；生产资产及玩法待验收。\n[[Animation/资产生产安全|保护契约]] · [[Animation/Kevin战斗动画实施|实施]] · [[GGYGO_流程_Kevin战斗动画.canvas|生成流程]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "montage_guard",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1760,
      "y": 560,
      "width": 800,
      "height": 420,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "## UGGYGOMontageGuardAnimInstance\nBase继承的原生播放屏障；引擎执行Montage。\n仅借用ScopeChain，保原生命周期身份；旧Scope只注销本人登记。\nNativeUpdateAnimation在GT检查真实Montage输入，向原节点发布能力与native counter。\n提供只读Acquire/Poll；不持GAS状态或CMC执行权。\n[[Animation/结构|Guard与姿态接口]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "montage_scope",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1760,
      "y": 1120,
      "width": 800,
      "height": 440,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "## FGGYGOMontagePlayGuardScope\nCaller栈拥有、不可复制/移动；原Guard仅借用登记。\nRequest：OriginalAnimInstance、RequestedMontage、CallerIdentity、IsCallerContextCurrent（原有纯上下文谓词）。\nCanExecute仅准许原生入口；Complete(CallerReturn)封存，GetResult返回Scope内引用，析构前必须复制。\nResult：Identity/Outcome/NativeStage/两返回值；bSealed与NativeStage分开。\n析构只注销原实例自身登记，不停Montage、不清ASC/Task状态。\n没有第二播放执行器/全局attempt表/计时器。"
    },
    {
      "id": "montage_guard_query",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2720,
      "y": 560,
      "width": 860,
      "height": 550,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "## Guard只读阶段查询\nTryGetCurrentMontagePlayGuardStage(CallerIdentity,OutNativeStage,bOutCompleted)\nGT只看最内层原登记/身份；false先Reset。\n无祖先替代、外部谓词或生命周期刷新；外调后重查。\nReturned/Completed只代表原生返回/Scope封存，不授Task/GA资源权限。\n[[Animation/结构#Montage播放Guard的静态契约|查询边界]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "montage_callers",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1760,
      "y": 1740,
      "width": 800,
      "height": 490,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "## ASC / Montage Task（跨模块）\nASC完整Super播放并复制Guard结果；GAS保有原Local/Rep/GA状态。\nTask消费原Result/Handle/Guard，管理事件/委托/scale lease。\nRequired-only native TickTask读Poll；失败精确Stop/归还资源/EndTask后发历史OnFailed。\n[[AbilitySystem/结构|原资源与派发边界]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "source_binding",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Source binding（native DTO）\nIdentity：原Producer/Character/Mesh、lifecycle/config代次。\n强Sequence/BS引用＋loop/rate/length/样本位置；无曲线副本、Graph状态或clock。\nStatus/Error明确；当前binding与原SavedMove有界保留，失效不能授权后继。\n[[Animation/曲线处理#1. 当前职责与依赖方向|发布与退休]]",
      "x": 1760,
      "y": 2500,
      "width": 800,
      "height": 360,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "action_pose_slot",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## FGGYGOAnimNode_ActionPoseSlot\n继承FAnimNode_Slot；原生Update/Evaluate/权重/Notify唯一执行混合。\n输入：Source/Slot、Body/Trajectory骨、组件对齐。\nPostEvaluateSourcePose仅借同次实际参与Source标量；Evaluate只写Body local translation。\nCheckCapability/ValidateMontageCapability→能力与诊断；epoch/failureSerial为派生状态。\nEditor包装UGGYGOAnimGraphNode_ActionPoseSlot持Node，编译校验/注册Slot。\n[[Animation/动作姿态修正|算法与最低能力]]",
      "x": 2720,
      "y": 1250,
      "width": 860,
      "height": 540,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "action_pose_contract",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Guard能力接口 / 原票据\nAcquireActionPoseContract(原Montage)→ExplicitNotRequired/RequiredReady/Rejected/Unavailable。\nGT原并行完成屏障后读取原compiled node；不强制Evaluate。\nPollActionPoseContract(原ticket)→Valid/Failed/Invalidated；不刷新旧票据。\nFGGYGOActionPoseContractTicket持原provider/Mesh/模型/Montage弱身份、node key/Slot、生命周期/epoch/故障基线。\n无native instance/pose/clock，Task销毁Reset。\n[[GGYGO_流程_动作姿态修正.canvas|触发、故障与清理]]",
      "x": 2720,
      "y": 1880,
      "width": 860,
      "height": 550,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "action_pose_boundary",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Mesh姿态 / CMC胶囊 / 验证\nBody相对Trajectory的Z归姿态节点；原生Slot混合，最终buffer含Inertialization。\nPosXYZ曲线区间与原生物理归CMC；node/provider不写Velocity/Acceleration/RequestedVelocity。\nGA持原CMC句柄并清理，Task清原播放/scale。\n最终证据仅Normal01 Main；两Pose故障行为PASS但报告Fail/真实Error保留。\n[[Animation/动作姿态修正#7. 实际证据与未验证边界|已验与未验]] · [[Movement/结构|CMC]]",
      "x": 2720,
      "y": 2540,
      "width": 860,
      "height": 450,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "action_motion_binding",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## FGGYGOActionMotionSourceBinding\nBuildSourceBinding(原Montage,显式Slot,Section)→原资产/段/速率只读配置。\nValidateSourceBinding→原配置一致；MapMontageInterval→原源片段区间。\n不读曲线、不推进clock、不签播放权限；GA/CMC/RMS/有界SavedMove按资源持引用。\n[[Movement/动作曲线执行|Movement求值与执行]]",
      "x": 1760,
      "y": 3060,
      "width": 800,
      "height": 360,
      "color": "4"
    }
  ],
